# armour/shared/pauldron_scale3_r: the medium scale pauldron on the right shoulder (scale.3; LADDER-ARMOUR,
# STYLE_P2 25.6 / 27.4: mail, scale and lamellar shoulders): rows of scale units on a cop, 2 px past the shoulder line,
# a solid band rim; the near views lit at the top-left, the far one in shadow behind the arm. It rides the lean and
# the bob and lifts a pixel on wind-ups (`up`). Finish regions: R the rim band, P the cop's face, W a spot on the shadow side.
# Shared by both bodies (D10). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h. Source: LADDER-ARMOUR's pauld.py + expand.py (fill: scale).
use person
role pauldron scale.3
layer armNear
anchor shoulderR
keys pauld
z 5
side R

